{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09119","headline":"送令狐岫宰恩阳 · 韦应物","name":"送令狐岫宰恩阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大雪天地闭，羣山夜来晴。\n居家犹苦寒，子有千里行。\n行行安得辞，荷此蒲璧荣。\n贤豪争追攀，饮饯出西京。\n樽酒岂不欢，暮春自有程。\n离人起视日，仆御促前征。\n逶迟岁已穷，当造巴子城。\n和风被草木，江水日夜清。\n从来知善政，离别慰友生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}